/T (To study the limitations of low-code platforms when they are applied to complex enterprise-level applications, using the Student Admission application built in Zoho Creator as the starting point, and to understand when pro-code extensions or a hybrid architecture become necessary.)
/E (To study the limitations of low-code platforms when they are applied to complex enterprise-level applications, using the Student Admission application built in Zoho Creator as the starting point, and to understand when pro-code extensions or a hybrid architecture become necessary.)
