/P 50 0 R
/T (As the institution grows, requirements become more demanding. Large numbers of applicants and programmes raise performance and data-management concerns; integration with payment, CRM and seat inventory systems raises integration concerns; differing access needs and the handling of personal and academic data raise security and governance concerns; and advanced features such as admission-likelihood forecasting need external services. In such cases extensions, integrations or custom development are needed in addition to the low-code application.)
/E (As the institution grows, requirements become more demanding. Large numbers of applicants and programmes raise performance and data-management concerns; integration with payment, CRM and seat inventory systems raises integration concerns; differing access needs and the handling of personal and academic data raise security and governance concerns; and advanced features such as admission-likelihood forecasting need external services. In such cases extensions, integrations or custom development are needed in addition to the low-code application.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [14]
>>
