/Title (enterprise requirements: performance and scalability, complex business logic, system integration, extreme UX customisation, security and governance, AI / ML and advanced technology, vendor or platform dependency, and heavy data transformations. It also showed how a three-tier hybrid architecture of a low-code application, pro-code extensions and enterprise systems can address requirements beyond standard low-code capabilities.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 21 0 R
/Prev 292 0 R
/Next 293 0 R
>>
