<<
/Title (Low-code platforms suit standard business applications. As the requirements of an enterprise grow in users, data volume, process complexity, integrations, security and customisation, the built-in capabilities of a platform may no longer be sufficient on their own. This case study examines such limitations by scaling up the Student Admission application from a single department's intake to an institution-wide admissions platform.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 465 0 R
/Prev 524 0 R
>>
